.TH TW 1 "August 2026" "TerminalWiki 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
tw \- fast, file-based terminal knowledge base and markdown viewer
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B tw
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] [\fIWIKI\fR] [\fIPAGE\fR]
.br
.B tw
\fICOMMAND\fR [\fIARGS...\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBTerminalWiki\fR is a high-performance terminal knowledge base system that indexes and renders markdown and code repositories directly from ordinary files on disk.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.BR tw " [" \fIPAGE\fR "]"
Displays a page or the wiki home overview.
.TP
.BR "tw search" " \fIQUERY\fR"
Performs full-text search against the persistent Tantivy index.
.TP
.BR "tw find" " \fIQUERY\fR"
Performs instant fuzzy search matching titles, paths, aliases, and tags.
.TP
.BR "tw tui" " [" \fIWIKI\fR "] [" \fIPAGE\fR "]"
Launches the interactive terminal user interface.
.TP
.BR "tw new" " \fIPAGE\fR"
Creates a new page with frontmatter and opens it in $EDITOR.
.TP
.BR "tw edit" " \fIPAGE\fR"
Opens the target page in $EDITOR.
.TP
.BR "tw backlinks" " \fIPAGE\fR"
Lists pages that contain incoming links to the target page.
.TP
.BR "tw links" " \fIPAGE\fR"
Lists outgoing links from the target page.
.TP
.BR "tw related" " \fIPAGE\fR"
Calculates deterministic related pages based on graph connectivity.
.TP
.BR "tw graph" " [" \fIPAGE\fR "]"
Renders the terminal-native link graph or exports Graphviz DOT format with \fB--format dot\fR.
.TP
.BR "tw tags" " [" \fIWIKI\fR "]"
Lists all tags across the wiki with frequency counts.
.TP
.BR "tw tag" " \fITAG\fR"
Lists pages tagged with \fITAG\fR.
.TP
.BR "tw wiki" " \fISUBCOMMAND\fR"
Manages registered wikis: \fBlist\fR, \fBadd\fR, \fBremove\fR, \fBrename\fR, \fBmount\fR, \fBunmount\fR, \fBdefault\fR.
.TP
.BR "tw index" " \fBstatus\fR|\fBupdate\fR|\fBrebuild\fR"
Manages search index status, incremental delta updates, or full rebuilds.
.TP
.BR "tw lint"
Scans the wiki for broken links, missing assets, and frontmatter diagnostics.
.TP
.BR "tw doctor"
Displays diagnostic report of configuration and terminal capabilities.
.TP
.BR "tw config"
Displays resolved configuration settings.
.TP
.BR "tw completions" " \fBbash\fR|\fBzsh\fR|\fBfish\fR"
Outputs shell completion script to stdout.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-\-wiki " \fINAME\fR"
Specifies the target wiki.
.TP
.BR \-\-all
Executes query or operation across all registered wikis.
.TP
.BR \-\-plain ", " \-\-no\-color
Disables ANSI styling and color output.
.TP
.BR \-\-json
Formats command output as JSON.
.TP
.BR \-\-jsonl
Formats search results as newline-delimited JSON.
.TP
.BR \-\-path\-only
Prints only file paths.
.TP
.BR \-\-version
Prints program version.
.TP
.BR \-\-help ", " \-h
Prints command help.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success.
.TP
.B 2
Invalid command-line arguments or usage.
.TP
.B 3
Page not found.
.TP
.B 4
Wiki not found.
.TP
.B 5
Search index error.
.TP
.B 6
Configuration error.
